## Ansible - Install Docker
```yaml 
- name: Install Docker
  hosts: all
  become: yes

  tasks:
    - name: Install Docker
      yum:
        name: docker
        state: present
    - name: Service started
      service:
        name: docker
        stat: started
        enabled: yes

# Terraform - Provisioning EC2 with VPC
